Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-21206:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Enhance the docs of --formatter to showcase the available formatters
                 Key: KAFKA-21206
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21206
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


There are many formatters which can parse the internal records, but we don't have any documentation for them. At the very least, we should list them in the help text of {{--formatter}} ({{{}messageFormatterOpt{}}}), and mention that {{exclude.internal.topics=false}} is required when reading internal topics.



