Subject: Re: About snappy-java CVEs (and unmaintained compression repos)
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
From: Martin Andersson <beregon87@gmail.com>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>
