Hi all,

Updated the reopened KIP-1165 with a more complete design for object
merging. The proposal defines consolidated topics, which are diskless
topics with a tiered prefix. The KIP defines the lifecycle of these topics,
behavior and replication: how a record moves through the stages of a topic,
how would it be stored and consumed until expiration.

Any feedback is welcome.

Best,
Viktor

