Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-21242:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Migrate Scala LogManager#apply to Java LogManger#create
                 Key: KAFKA-21242
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21242
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


{{kafka.log.LogManager#apply}} is a thin Scala factory that extracts config values from {{KafkaConfig}} and passes them to the Java {{LogManager}} constructor. We can move it to storage as {{LogManager#create(AbstractConfig, ...)}} and remove the Scala object.

Probably we can introduce a {{LogManagerConfig}} to consolidate those separate config items, which also shortens the constructor



