Nikita Shupletsov created KAFKA-21246:
-----------------------------------------

             Summary: Investigrate compression approaches for scatter-gather
                 Key: KAFKA-21246
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21246
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Nikita Shupletsov


Scatter-gather comes with a challenge: if we need to split a batch and it's compressed, we need to either flatten it(as flattening no longer happens), or be able to read multiple chunks through in the decompression path.

We need to investigate our options here.



