Luke Chen created KAFKA-21250:
---------------------------------

             Summary: KRaft Controller Election Preference Mechanism
                 Key: KAFKA-21250
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21250
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Luke Chen


In Zookeeper, there is a Hierarchical Quorums mechanism to allow to set som=
e nodes to have groups/weights to have higher possibility to be elected as =
the leader.

[https://zookeeper.apache.org/doc/r3.9.4/zookeeperInternals.html#sc_quorum]

[https://zookeeper.apache.org/doc/r3.9.4/zookeeperHierarchicalQuorums.html]

=C2=A0

The use case is that when there are 3 data center:=C2=A0

Datacenter A: 2 controllers
Datacenter B: 2 controllers
Datacenter C: 1 controller

=C2=A0

We hope that we form a quorum with either datacenter AC or BC, not AB.=C2=
=A0

We hope this feature can be implemented in KRaft quorum, too.



