What's you rational for doing 4.6 in March already? If we so 4.5 
early/mid January, it would be a very small release. Given the overhead 
releases have, I am wondering if it would be worth doing?

For 4.5, I am also ok to start a Jan/6 instead of Jan/13 with KIP 
freeze. If we do 4.6 in July (instead of March) I don't see a need to 
pull it forward by one a week though. But I am fine in any case.

-Matthias

