Verified the following:
- signatures and checksums of source/binary tarballs and staged maven artifac=
ts
- source tarball builds; ran unit and integration tests locally (a few
  streams/MM2 integration tests timed out on the first pass due to local
  resource limits, all passed on re-run)
- started a KRaft broker from the binary tarball, produce/consume works
- apache/kafka:4.3.2-rc3 and apache/kafka-native:4.3.2-rc3 start with the
  default config and accept client connections
- javadoc, release notes, and documentation links

Two small notes:
- the hyperlinks behind "Release notes" and "Release artifacts" point to
  4.3.2-rc/ instead of 4.3.2-rc3/ (the visible text is correct)
- system test results are still marked as "will provide it soon"

Thanks for running the release, Jiunn-Yang.

Chia-Ping

