Gaurav Narula created KAFKA-21265:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: DescribeConfigs request fails with UNKNOWN_SERVER_ERROR on internal list config
                 Key: KAFKA-21265
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21265
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Gaurav Narula
            Assignee: Gaurav Narula


Internal configs are not parsed in {{ConfigHelperUtils#createResponseConfig}} which results in {{ConfigDef::convertToString}} throwing {{ClassCastException}} when invoked via  {{ConfigHelper#createTopicConfigEntry}}

This is reproducible by testing against the newly introduced internal configuration {{mirror.replication.throttled.replicas}} which is of type list



