Hi Kafka community,

I'm a Java developer interested in contributing to Apache Kafka. I'm
beginning to explore the codebase and would like to start with a small,
beginner-friendly bug fix or test improvement.

I have experience with Java and Spring Boot, and I'm looking forward to
learning Kafka's internals, testing practices, and contribution workflow.

I've submitted a request for a Kafka JIRA account. In the meantime, I'd
appreciate any guidance on finding suitable beginner-friendly issues.

Thank you for your time!

Regards,
Akshay

