Ken Huang resolved KAFKA-21264.
-------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Javadoc output language depends on the build machine's system locale
> --------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-21264
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21264
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Improvement
>            Reporter: Ken Huang
>            Assignee: Jheng-Sing Chen
>            Priority: Minor
>
> The Javadoc task does not explicitly set a locale, so the {{javadoc}} tool falls back to the JVM's default locale. This locale is written to every generated page as {{{}<html lang="...">{}}}.
> we can set a fixed locale in the shared {{tasks.withType(Javadoc)}} block in {{build.gradle}}



