garding LC1, that makes sense. The tests can run on all supported Java vers=
ions rather than skipping the unsupported case entirely. On Java 20 and lat=
er, they can verify that configured named groups are applied. On earlier Ja=
va versions, a non-empty ssl.named.groups can be tested to ensure that crea=
ting the SSL engine throws an InvalidConfigurationException. Empty or unset=
