Hi Luke,

LC1: Yes we will have tests that exercise the unsupported code paths
with Java 17 in the CI. Updated

LC2.1 As Arnab said, the configuration takes precedence over the
system property. We already have the same behavior today with
ssl.cipher.suites and ssl.enabled.protocols which both have JVM system
properties too.

LC2.2: Right, I've added some more details in the compatibility section.

Thanks,
Mickael

