Dear Kafka,

I am writing to ask about an end-of-study internship at Kafka in artificial intelligence, machine learning, MLOps, or a related field. I am in my AI engineering program at ESPRIT and would be glad to contribute to your team while completing my final degree requirements.

Brief background: AI engineering degree at ESPRIT (in progress), computer science bachelor's from ISIMM. Recent experience: Talan (deep learning, CNN, ResNet, XAI), Medianet (agentic AI with LLMs; microservices on Kubernetes and GCP). Tools and stack: Python, TensorFlow, PyTorch, Scikit-learn, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS/GCP. Nvidia certifications in deep learning, generative AI, multimodal agents, and transformer-based NLP.

I attached my CV for more detail. If Kafka hosts end-of-study interns in AI, ML, MLOps, or close areas, I would welcome a short conversation.

Best regards,

Azer FATTOUCH
AI Engineering Student, ESPRIT

