Hi all,

While looking for flaky tests to investigate, I noticed that Flaky Test
Report #701 contains the following error in its job summary instead of the
expected report:

> Error occurred: 401 Client Error: Unauthorized for url:
> https://develocity.apache.org/api/tests/containers?...

Run: https://github.com/apache/kafka/actions/runs/39008289568

The workflow is marked successful despite the report-generation error.

Is this a known issue, or is anyone already looking into it?

Could someone with the appropriate access check the API authentication? It
may also be worth making report-generation errors fail the workflow so they
are more visible.

Thanks!

--0000000000004217b9065e0ba590--

