Subject: [jira] [Created] (KAFKA-21309) Consumer using SubscriptionPattern
 throws IllegalStateException on Metadata response for a deleted assigned
 topic"
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394
