No test exercises the retry/backoff path in NetworkClient#ensureBootstrappe=
d().

DNS resolution failing one or more times and then succeeding within the con=
figured `bootstrap.resolve.timeout.ms budget`.

Existing tests only cover instant success (literal IP bootstrap addresses) =
or permanent failure (BootstrapResolutionException after timeout).Add unit =
test coverage for the recovery case.

