Hi,

Actually there's a couple of compatibility issues.
This will break all custom implementations of Header and Headers. We
should probably add default methods since the logic would be the same
for custom implementations.
Also it seems add(String key, String value) may be ambiguous if called
with null because of the existing add(String key, byte[] value). Maybe
we could keep only the add(String key, String value, Charset charset)
alternative to resolve this.

Thanks,
Mickael

