@@ -0,0 +1,104 @@
+---
+date: 2026-10-22
+title: Apache Kafka 4.4.0 Release Announcement
+linkTitle: AK 4.4.0
+author: Omnia Ibrahim
+aliases:
+  - /blog/2026/10/22/apache-kafka-4.4.0-release-announcement/
+---
+
+<!--
