+* [KIP-1301: Deprecate Yammer-based metrics in GroupCoordinatorMetrics](https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/406623591/KIP-1301+Deprecate+Yammer-based+metrics+in+GroupCoordinatorMetrics)
