Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-21352:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Deprecate KafkaCSVMetricsReporter, KafkaMetricsReporterMBean, KafkaMetricsReporter and VerifiableProperties
                 Key: KAFKA-21352
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21352
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


They aim to offer the ability to read or dump the Yammer metrics. However, dumping can be done with JmxTool (yes, we have an official tool). If JMX is disabled, users can leverage the MetricsReporter interface to access the Yammer metrics.

KAFKA-14893 is used to discuss exposing Yammer metrics as public APIs. It is unrelated to this ticket, since Yammer metrics could be exposed via MetricsReporter if we do want to do that.



