Hi,

I fully support your efforts regarding 3.9.3 release.

Do you think that
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/440303727/KIP-1362+A=
dd+a+rollback-compatible+storage+format+option+for+KRaft+migration

could be something to include in 3.9.3? It seems to be stuck in the KIP
phase, so the pull request is also stuck.

