Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-21371:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: The docs of partitioner.rack.aware should mention partitioner.ignore.keys and client.rack
                 Key: KAFKA-21371
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21371
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


The condition of enabling `partitioner.rack.aware` is not only related to "custom partitioner" but also `partitioner.ignore.keys`. It only takes effect for records without a key, or all records when `partitioner.ignore.keys=true`. The docs of `partitioner.rack.aware`, `partitioner.class` and `client.rack` should say so.



--
