>=20
> This is a bugfix release in the 4.3 line. It fixes around 60 issues since t=
he
> 4.3.1 release, most notably two potential data loss issues in tiered storage
> size-based retention and time index truncation, along with dependency updat=
es
> addressing published CVEs in jackson-databind, lz4-java, log4j and Jetty.
>=20
> All of the changes in this release can be found in the release notes:
> https://downloads.apache.org/kafka/4.3.2/RELEASE_NOTES.html
>=20
>=20
