--------------------------------------

             Summary: Remove the sasl infra from UserQuotaTest
                 Key: KAFKA-21373
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21373
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


{{UserQuotaTest}} uses {{SaslSetup}} to generate the non-anonymous principal. We could set up a custom principal builder to mock the principal and then remove the sasl infra to speed up the test. The MiniKdc and SSL handshake cost about 3.5 seconds per test method. For example, {{testProducerConsumerOverrideUnthrottled}} drops from 5s to 1.3s.



