             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


`partitioner.rack.aware` allows user to adjust the route to try the rack as=
 much as possible. However, it is hard to observe the "miss" from client si=
de since we didn't add any metrics for that.

Since the rack is used to save money, the unit of metrics should be bytes. =
It should record the size of produce requests sent to brokers whose rack di=
ffers from `client.rack`.=C2=A0

This is useful even without `partitioner.rack.aware`, as users can see the =
cross-rack traffic before and after enabling it.



