Luke Chen created KAFKA-21378:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Add "leaderEpoch" field in PartitionChangeRecord
                 Key: KAFKA-21378
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21378
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Luke Chen


To support "bumpLeaderEpoch" RPC in the future, we should add a "leaderEpoc=
h" field in PartitionChangeRecord, and move the leader epoch calculation lo=
gic from currently each node calculate the leader epoch when replying Parti=
tionChangeRecord in PartitionRegistration class, to each time the Partition=
ChangeRecord creates, and each node only needs to take the leaderEpoch in t=
he PartitionChangeRecord.

=C2=A0

We should also consider the backward compatibility in this change.



