             Summary: Backport CVE fixes to 3.9
                 Key: KAFKA-21381
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21381
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: Gergely Harmad=C3=A1s
